@page "/components/scroll-area"

<PageTitle>Scroll Area — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Scroll Area</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    The platform's own thin scrollbar in the theme's colours. Radix draws its own with a resize
    observer and a computed thumb; this is most of the look for none of the script, and it still
    works with the wheel, a trackpad, the keyboard and a touch screen.
</p>
<p class="doc-note">
    The viewport is focusable, because a scrollable region that cannot take focus cannot be
    scrolled without a pointer — which is the accessibility failure a custom scrollbar usually
    introduces rather than fixes.
</p>

